WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.607 --> 00:00:11.004
PRÓ123F and PRÓ124F clash at
Tuesday 08:20 (red, purple).

2
00:00:11.104 --> 00:00:15.008
Núllstilla puts it back.

3
00:00:15.108 --> 00:00:21.010
Víðværar stillingar (course-wide):
Samkennt með (co-taught with).

4
00:00:21.110 --> 00:00:26.013
Taught together as one class:
add PRÓ124F.

5
00:00:26.113 --> 00:00:30.643
Staðfesta og vista
(confirm and save).

6
00:00:30.743 --> 00:00:37.720
The same move: no clash –
they are one class now.

7
00:00:37.820 --> 00:00:42.722
They may also share a room:
no ⛔ for HT-104.

8
00:00:42.822 --> 00:00:48.726
Núllstilla puts the lecture back;
the co-teaching stays saved.
